         ORG 100

Loop,    Load        ArrayBaseAddress
         Add         ArrayCellIndex
         Store       ArrayCellAddress / new address of a[i]

         LoadI       ArrayCellAddress
         /Clear
         /AddI       ArrayCellAddress
                  
         Skipcond    400              / check if a[i] == ’\0’
         Jump        BodyLoop
         Jump        EndLoop

BodyLoop, Output      / output a[i]

         Load        ArrayCellIndex
         Add         One
         Store       ArrayCellIndex   / i++

         Jump        Loop

EndLoop, Halt

String, Dec	072  / H
	Dec	101  / e
	Dec	108  / l
	Dec	108  / l 
	Dec	111  / o
	Dec	032  / [space]
	Dec	119  / w
	Dec	111  / o
	Dec	114  / r
	Dec	108  / l
	Dec	100  / d
	Dec	033  / !
	Dec	000  / [null]
ArrayBaseAddress, Hex 10D / address of a[0]
/ArrayBaseAddress, Hex 10E / address of a[0]
ArrayCellAddress, Hex 000 / address of a[i]
ArrayCellIndex,   Dec 0   / index i
One,              Dec 1   / constant 1
